From Homegrown Ideas to Brands That Make a Mark

India's entrepreneurial landscape is witnessing the emergence of new-age brands that are challenging conventions, connecting with evolving consumer aspirations and creating distinctive identities. From innovative business ideas to compelling brand experiences, homegrown enterprises are shaping the next chapter of India's business story.

Dimple Fouzdar, Founder, Maison De Fouzdar, will join the News18 Rising Bharat Summit – North Edition, sharing her entrepreneurial journey, insights on building a distinctive brand identity and the opportunities and challenges involved in creating and scaling new-age Indian brands.

