Powering India's Semiconductor Revolution

Semiconductors are at the heart of today's technological transformation, driving innovation across electronics, automobiles, telecommunications and advanced manufacturing. As India works towards building a stronger semiconductor ecosystem, developing domestic capabilities, attracting investments and fostering industry collaboration will be crucial to realising its ambitions.

Anand Kumar, Board of Directors, IESA, will join the News18 Rising Bharat Summit – North Edition, sharing his insights on India's growing semiconductor ambitions, the opportunities shaping the chip industry and how a stronger domestic ecosystem can position India as a significant player in the global semiconductor landscape.

